## Usage

### Example 1: Browsing Products
1. Navigate to the homepage
2. Browse the marketplace showing available agricultural products
3. View product details including price, farmer information, and ratings
4. Add products to cart for later purchase

### Example 2: AI Market Analysis
1. Click on any product to view its detail page
2. Scroll down to the "AI Market Insights" section
3. Click "Analyze Market" to trigger the AI agent
4. View the analysis including:
